        {
          "text": "Elyo nindakabona, ndakanyampuka, ndaambila basilutwe abapati abantu bamwi kuti, Mutabayoowi. Amwiingasile Mwami mupati uuyoosya. Amulwide bakwanu abana banu balombe abana banu basimbi abanakazi banu amaanda aanu.",
          "type": "text",
