          "text": "Nkabela kuzwa kubuzuba obo, cisela cabalanda bangu bakali kubeleka milimo, acisela cimwi bakalijisi masumo antobo amata azilwisyo, abalo bapati bakali kugwasya luzubo lwa-Juda, ",
          "type": "text",
